[
  {
    "id": "CAT-RISKY-01",
    "title": "递归强制删除（rm -rf / Remove-Item -Recurse -Force）",
    "domain": "risky",
    "evidence": {
      "level": "文献",
      "hits": 0,
      "sessions": 0,
      "source": "依据：Google Gemini CLI 曾清空用户整个 D 盘 8000+ 文件（avakill README 汇总引用，二手资料）。"
    },
    "falsePositiveRisk": "medium",
    "defaultAction": "warn",
    "when": "tool:pre",
    "appliesTo": {
      "tool": "pwsh",
      "commandMatches": "rm\\s+-|Remove-Item"
    },
    "condition": {
      "all": [
        {
          "type": "regexHit",
          "in": "args.command",
          "pattern": "(^|[;&|]\\s*)rm\\s+-[A-Za-z-]*r|Remove-Item[^;\\n]{0,80}-Recurse"
        },
        {
          "type": "regexMiss",
          "in": "args.command",
          "pattern": "_tmp|\\\\[Tt]mp\\\\|\\\\temp\\\\|\\bbuild\\b|\\bdist\\b|node_modules|[Cc]ache|\\.git"
        }
      ]
    },
    "message": "这条命令会递归强删，删掉的东西进不了回收站",
    "fix": "先确认目标路径；能列出来看一眼就先列；需要保留的先复制一份",
    "severity": "S",
    "reversible": false,
    "notes": [
      "依据：Google Gemini CLI 曾清空用户整个 D 盘 8000+ 文件（avakill README 汇总引用，二手资料）。",
      "这条只提示不拦——删目录在某些正当任务里就是要做，拦死会挡住真需求。",
      "2026-11-22 历史回放校准：初版把 -Force 也算上、共命中 405 次（2.16%），绝大多数是清 _tmp；改为只认 -Recurse 且排除临时/构建目录后降到个位数。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "CAT-RISKY-02",
    "title": "变量展开路径的递归删除（rm -rf \"$X\"/）",
    "domain": "risky",
    "evidence": {
      "level": "文献",
      "hits": 0,
      "sessions": 0,
      "source": "这是经典事故模式：变量没赋值 → rm -rf \\\"/\\\" 或 rm -rf \\\"./\\\" 全清。"
    },
    "falsePositiveRisk": "high",
    "defaultAction": "steer",
    "when": "tool:pre",
    "appliesTo": {
      "tool": "pwsh",
      "commandMatches": "rm\\s"
    },
    "condition": {
      "all": [
        {
          "type": "regexHit",
          "in": "args.command",
          "pattern": "rm\\s+-[A-Za-z-]*[rf][^\\n]*\\$\\{?[A-Za-z_]"
        },
        {
          "type": "regexMiss",
          "in": "args.command",
          "pattern": "_tmp|\\\\[Tt]mp\\\\|\\\\temp\\\\|[Cc]ache|\\bbuild\\b|\\bdist\\b|node_modules"
        }
      ]
    },
    "message": "路径来自变量，变量为空时这条命令可能删到当前目录或更上层",
    "fix": "先回显变量确认非空（echo \"$X\"），并在命令里加非空判断",
    "severity": "S",
    "reversible": false,
    "notes": "这是经典事故模式：变量没赋值 → rm -rf \"/\" 或 rm -rf \"./\" 全清。,误拦风险标 high：变量通常是有值的，多数情况会误报，所以只能提示。 2026-11-22 自测：不加临时目录排除会把「删 $env:TEMP\\build」当危险动作报出来，已加排除。"
  },
  {
    "id": "CAT-RISKY-03",
    "title": "数据库删表或清空（DROP / TRUNCATE）",
    "domain": "risky",
    "evidence": {
      "level": "文献",
      "hits": 0,
      "sessions": 0,
      "source": "依据：Replit 的 agent 删掉生产数据库并伪造约 4000 个假用户记录掩盖（avakill README 汇总引用，二手资料）。"
    },
    "falsePositiveRisk": "medium",
    "defaultAction": "warn",
    "when": "tool:pre",
    "appliesTo": {
      "tool": "pwsh",
      "commandMatches": "DROP\\s+TABLE|TRUNCATE\\s+TABLE|deleteMany|dropDatabase"
    },
    "condition": {
      "type": "regexHit",
      "in": "args.command",
      "pattern": "(DROP|TRUNCATE)\\s+(TABLE|DATABASE|SCHEMA)|dropDatabase|deleteMany\\(\\s*\\{\\s*\\}"
    },
    "message": "这是删表/清库操作，数据不在文件系统里，快照回退救不回来",
    "fix": "确认连的是哪个库；有备份就从备份恢复；没有就先导出一份",
    "severity": "S",
    "reversible": false,
    "notes": [
      "依据：Replit 的 agent 删掉生产数据库并伪造约 4000 个假用户记录掩盖（avakill README 汇总引用，二手资料）。",
      "deleteMany({}) 与 DROP 同效，一并算上。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "CAT-RISKY-04",
    "title": "没有 WHERE 的 DELETE 或 UPDATE",
    "domain": "risky",
    "evidence": {
      "level": "文献",
      "hits": 0,
      "sessions": 0,
      "source": "依据：通用数据库安全常识，也是 agent 手滑的高频形态。"
    },
    "falsePositiveRisk": "medium",
    "defaultAction": "warn",
    "when": "tool:pre",
    "appliesTo": {
      "tool": "pwsh",
      "commandMatches": "DELETE\\s+FROM|UPDATE\\s+[A-Za-z_\"]+\\s+SET"
    },
    "condition": {
      "all": [
        {
          "type": "regexHit",
          "in": "args.command",
          "pattern": "(DELETE|UPDATE)\\s"
        },
        {
          "type": "regexMiss",
          "in": "args.command",
          "pattern": "\\bWHERE\\b"
        }
      ]
    },
    "message": "这条 SQL 没有 WHERE，整张表都会被改或删",
    "fix": "先写 SELECT 数一下影响行数，再加 WHERE",
    "severity": "S",
    "reversible": false,
    "notes": [
      "依据：通用数据库安全常识，也是 agent 手滑的高频形态。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "CAT-RISKY-05",
    "title": "丢弃未提交改动（git reset --hard / checkout -- . / clean -fd）",
    "domain": "risky",
    "evidence": {
      "level": "文献",
      "hits": 0,
      "sessions": 0,
      "source": "依据：通用版本控制常识；AI 修 bug 时最常用来「回到干净状态」，而用户的未提交改动就在里面。"
    },
    "falsePositiveRisk": "medium",
    "defaultAction": "warn",
    "when": "tool:pre",
    "appliesTo": {
      "tool": "pwsh",
      "commandMatches": "git\\s+(reset|checkout|clean)"
    },
    "condition": {
      "type": "regexHit",
      "in": "args.command",
      "pattern": "git\\s+reset\\s+--hard|git\\s+checkout\\s+--\\s+\\.|git\\s+clean\\s+-(?![a-zA-Z]*n)[a-zA-Z]*[fd]"
    },
    "message": "这条命令会丢弃未提交的改动，代码找不回来",
    "fix": "先 git stash 或 git commit 存一下；确认没有要留的改动再执行",
    "severity": "S",
    "reversible": false,
    "notes": "依据：通用版本控制常识；AI 修 bug 时最常用来「回到干净状态」，而用户的未提交改动就在里面。 2026-11-22 自测：-n 是只看会删什么（dry-run），必须排除，否则 git clean -nd 被误报。"
  },
