  {
    "id": "CAT-RISKY-10",
    "title": "覆盖已存在的脚本或配置文件（重定向 / 写文件到已有路径）",
    "domain": "risky",
    "evidence": {
      "level": "文献",
      "hits": 0,
      "sessions": 0,
      "source": "依据：本轮开发中真实发生——改 .ps1 时整篇覆盖，把原文件里别的内容一起带走了。"
    },
    "falsePositiveRisk": "high",
    "defaultAction": "steer",
    "when": "tool:pre",
    "appliesTo": {
      "tool": "pwsh",
      "commandMatches": "Out-File|Set-Content|>|Copy-Item|Move-Item"
    },
    "condition": {
      "type": "regexHit",
      "in": "args.command",
      "pattern": "(Out-File|Set-Content)\\s+[^;\\n]{0,60}\\.(ps1|json|yml|yaml|toml|ini|env)\\b"
    },
    "message": "这条命令会写到配置或脚本文件上，原内容会被覆盖",
    "fix": "写之前先看一眼原文件；能只改一处就别整篇覆盖",
    "severity": "S",
    "reversible": true,
    "notes": [
      "依据：本轮开发中真实发生——改 .ps1 时整篇覆盖，把原文件里别的内容一起带走了。",
      "2026-11-22 历史回放校准：初版含 Copy-Item/Move-Item，145 次里绝大多数是打包复制；只留 Out-File/Set-Content 后大幅下降。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "CAT-RISKY-11",
    "title": "删根目录或系统盘根",
    "domain": "risky",
    "evidence": {
      "level": "文献",
      "hits": 0,
      "sessions": 0,
      "source": "没有正当理由会执行；无法从历史日志取证据，因为从未发生过"
    },
    "falsePositiveRisk": "low",
    "defaultAction": "block",
    "when": "tool:pre",
    "appliesTo": {
      "tool": "pwsh",
      "commandMatches": "rm\\s+-|Remove-Item"
    },
    "condition": {
      "type": "regexHit",
      "in": "args.command",
      "pattern": "rm\\s+-[A-Za-z-]*r[A-Za-z-]*\\s+(\\/\\*?|~\\/?|\\$HOME)\\/?\\s*($|[;&|)])|(Remove-Item|rmdir|rd)\\b[^;|\\n]{0,60}(-Recurse|\\/s)[^;|\\n]{0,40}[A-Za-z]:[\\\\/]?\\s*($|[;&|)])"
    },
    "message": "这条命令删的是根目录或整个系统盘，删掉就回不来了",
    "fix": "确认要删的具体是哪个子目录，把路径写全；只删自己创建的东西",
    "severity": "S",
    "reversible": false,
    "notes": "2026-11-22 用户批准破例：动作几乎没有正当理由，允许越过「文献级最多 warn」的限制直接拦。",
    "hardline": true,
    "selfTest": {
      "needFs": false,
      "cases": [
        {
          "args": {
            "command": "rm -rf /",
            "description": "删根"
          },
          "expect": "block"
        },
        {
          "args": {
            "command": "Remove-Item -Recurse -Force C:\\",
            "description": "删系统盘"
          },
          "expect": "block"
        },
        {
          "args": {
            "command": "rm -rf D:\\work\\src",
            "description": "删某个子目录"
          },
          "expect": "pass"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
